                            6
                            <b><span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَانَى</span></b> 
                        
                        <i>He was,</i> or <i>became, languid, remiss,
weak, feeble,</i> or <i>faint,</i> (T, S, M, MA, Msb, K, *)
in actions, and affairs, (T,) in respect of an
object of his want, (S,) or in an affair. (MA,
Msb.) ― 
       <p class="alpheios-lex-sense-separator"> </p><span class="alpheios-lex-sense-spacer2"> </span>-b2-  <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">تَوَانَى فى الأَمْرِ</span>
                        <i>He flagged,</i> or <i>was
remiss, in the affair;</i> (Msb;) <i>i. q.</i>
                        <span class="alpheios-lex-ar" lang="ara">قَصَّرَ</span>. (S.)

